                <pb facs="0265" n="159" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg159"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Mr.
                            Egan.</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-09-07"><hi rendition="#italic">September 7,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Wharton asks whether Mr. Egan has received his telegram, of the 4th instant,
                    and directs him to telegraph his answer.</p>
            </div>
